Scope: seal/tree traversal/manifest only.
Formal seal now requires --execution pointing to an external completed run.json. It verifies ended_at, exit_code, terminal_status and exact workspace match, then copies execution.json into the seal.
Baseline and result are filtered identically before patch generation. Recovery applies the saved relative-path patch in a new directory and compares file hashes, additions/deletions, modes and symlink records through the manifest. .env and target are absent from patch inputs.
Symlinks are recorded with target and mode; internal file and directory links are preserved, while links resolving outside the source are rejected. tree_hashes handles link records.
